  "slides": [
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden\" data-slide-title=\"Title\" data-slide-type=\"title\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8; font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"relative h-full w-full flex flex-col justify-between px-28 py-24\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<span class=\"text-[13px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">Meridian</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px] tracking-[0.08em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Confidential — Board of Directors</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"w-12 h-px mb-10\" style=\"background-color:#0f766e;\"></div>\n<h1 class=\"text-[84px] leading-[1.02] font-medium\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">FY27 Strategy</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-6 text-[20px] font-light\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\">Focus where we are strongest. Fix what erodes margin. Fund only three things.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-end justify-between border-t pt-6\" style=\"border-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-16\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Presented by</p>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] mt-1\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">Dana Whitfield, Chief Executive Officer</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Date</p>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] mt-1\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">March 2026</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-[13px]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">01 / 08</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden\" data-slide-title=\"Situation\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8; font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"relative h-full w-full flex flex-col px-28 py-20\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n<span class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Situation</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">02 / 08</span>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-[44px] leading-[1.12] font-medium max-w-[980px]\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">Growth is strong — but two-thirds of new ARR comes from a single segment.</h2>\n<div class=\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-3 gap-px mt-14\" style=\"background-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center px-10\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8;\">\n<p class=\"text-[64px] leading-none font-medium\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">$84M</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] mt-4 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">ARR, FY26 exit</p>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] mt-2 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\">Up from $64M a year ago; net revenue retention of 112%.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center px-10\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8;\">\n<p class=\"text-[64px] leading-none font-medium\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">+31%</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] mt-4 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">YoY ARR growth</p>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] mt-2 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\">Third consecutive year above 30%, ahead of mid-market SaaS peers.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center px-10\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8;\">\n<p class=\"text-[64px] leading-none font-medium\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#0f766e;\">68%</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] mt-4 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">of new ARR from mid-market logistics</p>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] mt-2 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\">The number that tells the real story: our engine is one segment, one motion.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-8 pt-5 border-t\" style=\"color:#9a9a94; border-color:#e3e3de;\">Source: Meridian FY26 management accounts, unaudited.</p>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden\" data-slide-title=\"The strategic tension\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8; font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"relative h-full w-full flex flex-col px-28 py-20\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n<span class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">The Problem</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">03 / 08</span>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-[44px] leading-[1.12] font-medium max-w-[1020px]\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">Our cost to serve is rising 9% a year while our price power grows only 2%.</h2>\n<div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center gap-16 mt-8\">\n<div class=\"flex-1\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-3\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Cost to serve vs. realized price per account · indexed, FY23 = 100</p>\n<canvas height=\"360\" id=\"chart-3ba7e1\" width=\"740\"></canvas>\n<script>(() => { const canvas = document.querySelector('#chart-3ba7e1'); if (!canvas) return; new Chart(canvas, { type: 'line', data: { labels: ['FY23', 'FY24', 'FY25', 'FY26'], datasets: [ { label: 'Cost to serve', data: [100, 109, 119, 130], borderColor: '#0f766e', backgroundColor: '#0f766e', borderWidth: 2.5, pointRadius: 3.5, tension: 0 }, { label: 'Realized price', data: [100, 102, 104, 106], borderColor: '#b8b8b2', backgroundColor: '#b8b8b2', borderWidth: 2, pointRadius: 3, tension: 0 } ] }, options: { responsive: false, animation: false, layout: { padding: { top: 24, right: 60 } }, plugins: { legend: { display: false }, datalabels: { align: 'top', anchor: 'end', color: (ctx) => ctx.datasetIndex === 0 ? '#0f766e' : '#9a9a94', font: { family: 'Inter', size: 12, weight: '600' }, formatter: (v, ctx) => ctx.dataIndex === ctx.dataset.data.length - 1 || ctx.dataIndex === 0 ? v : '' } }, scales: { x: { grid: { display: false }, border: { color: '#e3e3de' }, ticks: { color: '#9a9a94', font: { family: 'Inter', size: 12 } } }, y: { display: false, min: 92, max: 140 } } } }); })();</script>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-2\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Direct labels: teal = cost to serve (the series that matters); gray = realized net price. Source: FY26 cohort economics.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-[320px] border-l pl-12\" style=\"border-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<p class=\"text-[48px] leading-none font-medium\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">74% → 68%</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] mt-3 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Gross margin, FY23 → FY26</p>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] mt-6 leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\">Custom onboarding, bespoke integrations, and enterprise one-offs consume support capacity we never priced for. Left unresolved, this gap absorbs the entire benefit of scale by FY28.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden\" data-slide-title=\"Where we play\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8; font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"relative h-full w-full flex flex-col px-28 py-20\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n<span class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Where We Play</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">04 / 08</span>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-[44px] leading-[1.12] font-medium max-w-[1020px]\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">We win by owning mid-market logistics in North America and the UK — not by chasing enterprise.</h2>\n<div class=\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-2 gap-20 mt-12\">\n<div class=\"border-t pt-8\" style=\"border-color:#1a1a2e;\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] font-semibold\" style=\"color:#0f766e;\">Where we will play</p>\n<div class=\"mt-8 space-y-7\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">01</span>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Mid-market logistics operators</span> (50–500 fleet vehicles) — where our win rate is 42% and payback is under 14 months.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">02</span>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">North America and the UK</span> — markets where regulation, language, and our partner channel already work in our favor.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">03</span>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Adjacent field-service operators</span> — same buyer, same workflow, sold through the existing motion, not a new one.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-t pt-8\" style=\"border-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] font-semibold\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Where we will not play</p>\n<div class=\"mt-8 space-y-7\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#b8b8b2;\">—</span>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">No enterprise deals above 1,000 vehicles.</span> They demand custom builds, 9-month cycles, and the discounting that created our margin problem.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#b8b8b2;\">—</span>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">No continental Europe entry in FY27.</span> Localization and compliance costs exceed the three-year return at our current scale.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#b8b8b2;\">—</span>\n<p class=\"text-[16px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">No new product lines.</span> We deepen the platform we have; we do not open a second front.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-6 pt-5 border-t\" style=\"color:#9a9a94; border-color:#e3e3de;\">The \"not\" list is the strategy. Every FY27 investment decision is tested against it.</p>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden\" data-slide-title=\"How we win\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8; font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"relative h-full w-full flex flex-col px-28 py-20\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n<span class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">How We Win</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">05 / 08</span>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-[44px] leading-[1.12] font-medium max-w-[1000px]\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">Three advantages compound in our segment — and none of them travel well for our competitors.</h2>\n<div class=\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-3 gap-px mt-14\" style=\"background-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col px-10 py-10\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8;\">\n<span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#0f766e;\">01</span>\n<h3 class=\"text-[24px] font-medium mt-4 leading-snug\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">Workflow depth</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] mt-4 leading-relaxed flex-1\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\">Eleven years of routing and compliance logic built for mid-fleet operations — the reason our churn is 6% against a segment norm near 14%.</p>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-6 pt-4 border-t uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94; border-color:#e3e3de;\">Defensible: replication requires the segment focus rivals refuse to make</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col px-10 py-10\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8;\">\n<span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#0f766e;\">02</span>\n<h3 class=\"text-[24px] font-medium mt-4 leading-snug\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">Channel distribution</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] mt-4 leading-relaxed flex-1\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\">Partnerships with the three largest fleet-insurance brokers now source 38% of pipeline at roughly half the CAC of direct outbound.</p>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-6 pt-4 border-t uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94; border-color:#e3e3de;\">Defensible: exclusive integrations renewed through FY28</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col px-10 py-10\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8;\">\n<span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#0f766e;\">03</span>\n<h3 class=\"text-[24px] font-medium mt-4 leading-snug\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">Cost structure</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] mt-4 leading-relaxed flex-1\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\">A single-platform architecture and standardized onboarding let us serve a $60K account profitably where enterprise vendors need $200K to break even.</p>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-6 pt-4 border-t uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94; border-color:#e3e3de;\">Defensible: enterprise cost bases cannot follow us down-market</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden\" data-slide-title=\"Strategic priorities\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8; font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"relative h-full w-full flex flex-col px-28 py-20\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n<span class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Priorities</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">06 / 08</span>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-[44px] leading-[1.12] font-medium max-w-[1020px]\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">We fund exactly three priorities in FY27 — everything else waits.</h2>\n<div class=\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-3 gap-px mt-14\" style=\"background-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-col px-10 py-10\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8;\">\n<span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#0f766e;\">P1</span>\n<h3 class=\"text-[22px] font-medium mt-4 leading-snug\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">Restore gross margin through packaged onboarding</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] mt-4 leading-relaxed flex-1\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\">Standardize the three highest-cost service motions and reprice custom work at full cost recovery.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-6 pt-5 border-t\" style=\"border-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<p class=\"text-[36px] leading-none font-medium\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">72%</p>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-2 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Gross margin by FY27 exit · Owner: COO, R. Okafor</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col px-10 py-10\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8;\">\n<span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#0f766e;\">P2</span>\n<h3 class=\"text-[22px] font-medium mt-4 leading-snug\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">Double the broker channel's share of pipeline</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] mt-4 leading-relaxed flex-1\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\">Extend the three insurance-broker integrations into co-sold offers and add two regional brokers in the UK.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-6 pt-5 border-t\" style=\"border-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<p class=\"text-[36px] leading-none font-medium\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">55%</p>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-2 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Of pipeline channel-sourced, from 38% · Owner: CRO, M. Tran</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col px-10 py-10\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8;\">\n<span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#0f766e;\">P3</span>\n<h3 class=\"text-[22px] font-medium mt-4 leading-snug\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">Open the field-service adjacency with the existing motion</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] mt-4 leading-relaxed flex-1\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\">Launch a field-service configuration of the current platform — no new codebase, no new sales team.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-6 pt-5 border-t\" style=\"border-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<p class=\"text-[36px] leading-none font-medium\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">$6M</p>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-2 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">New ARR from field service · Owner: CPO, A. Reyes</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-6 pt-5 border-t\" style=\"color:#9a9a94; border-color:#e3e3de;\">Each priority maps to one advantage on slide 05: cost structure, channel distribution, workflow depth. Nothing on this list requires a capability we do not already have.</p>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden\" data-slide-title=\"Financial trajectory\" data-slide-type=\"content\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8; font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"relative h-full w-full flex flex-col px-28 py-20\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n<span class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Financial Trajectory</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">07 / 08</span>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-[44px] leading-[1.12] font-medium max-w-[1020px]\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">The plan takes ARR from $84M to $158M by FY29 — while margin recovers, not despite it.</h2>\n<div class=\"flex-1 flex items-center gap-16 mt-6\">\n<div class=\"flex-1\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-3\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">ARR, $M · FY26 actual, FY27–FY29 plan vs. pre-strategy baseline</p>\n<canvas height=\"340\" id=\"chart-a4c92f\" width=\"720\"></canvas>\n<script>(() => { const canvas = document.querySelector('#chart-a4c92f'); if (!canvas) return; new Chart(canvas, { type: 'line', data: { labels: ['FY26', 'FY27', 'FY28', 'FY29'], datasets: [ { label: 'FY27 plan', data: [84, 106, 130, 158], borderColor: '#0f766e', backgroundColor: '#0f766e', borderWidth: 2.5, pointRadius: 3.5, tension: 0 }, { label: 'Pre-strategy baseline', data: [84, 100, 116, 132], borderColor: '#b8b8b2', backgroundColor: '#b8b8b2', borderWidth: 2, borderDash: [5, 5], pointRadius: 3, tension: 0 } ] }, options: { responsive: false, animation: false, layout: { padding: { top: 26, right: 64 } }, plugins: { legend: { display: false }, datalabels: { align: 'top', anchor: 'end', color: (ctx) => ctx.datasetIndex === 0 ? '#0f766e' : '#9a9a94', font: { family: 'Inter', size: 12, weight: '600' }, formatter: (v, ctx) => ctx.dataIndex === 0 || ctx.dataIndex === ctx.dataset.data.length - 1 ? '$' + v + 'M' : '' } }, scales: { x: { grid: { display: false }, border: { color: '#e3e3de' }, ticks: { color: '#9a9a94', font: { family: 'Inter', size: 12 } } }, y: { display: false, min: 70, max: 178 } } } }); })();</script>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-2\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Teal = FY27 plan (the path we commit to); dashed gray = baseline without the three priorities. Source: FY27 operating plan, base case.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-[320px] border-l pl-12\" style=\"border-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<p class=\"text-[48px] leading-none font-medium\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">$158M</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] mt-3 uppercase tracking-[0.1em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">ARR by FY29 exit · 23% CAGR</p>\n<div class=\"mt-8 pt-6 border-t space-y-5\" style=\"border-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">Assumption 1.</span> Channel share of pipeline reaches 55% by FY27, holding blended CAC flat.</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">Assumption 2.</span> Gross margin recovers to 72% in FY27 and 74% by FY29 via packaged onboarding.</p>\n<p class=\"text-[13px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">Assumption 3.</span> Field service contributes $6M ARR in FY27, scaling to $18M by FY29.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "<section class=\"relative h-[720px] w-[1280px] overflow-hidden\" data-slide-title=\"Risks and asks\" data-slide-type=\"closing\" style=\"background-color:#fafaf8; font-family:Inter, sans-serif;\">\n<div class=\"relative h-full w-full flex flex-col px-28 py-20\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n<span class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Risks &amp; Asks</span>\n<span class=\"text-[13px]\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">08 / 08</span>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-[44px] leading-[1.12] font-medium max-w-[1020px]\" style=\"font-family:Fraunces, serif; color:#1a1a2e;\">Three risks are managed; three decisions from this board unlock the plan.</h2>\n<div class=\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-2 gap-20 mt-10\">\n<div class=\"border-t pt-7\" style=\"border-color:#e3e3de;\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] font-semibold\" style=\"color:#9a9a94;\">Top risks · with mitigation</p>\n<div class=\"mt-7 space-y-6\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#b8b8b2;\">R1</span>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">Broker channel concentration.</span> Three partners source 38% of pipeline. Mitigation: multi-year renewals signed through FY28; two new UK brokers added by Q2.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#b8b8b2;\">R2</span>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">Repricing triggers churn.</span> Packaged onboarding raises effective price for ~15% of accounts. Mitigation: grandfathering for top-quartile NRR accounts; churn guardrail at 8%.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#b8b8b2;\">R3</span>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#6b6b66;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">Field-service adjacency distracts the core.</span> Mitigation: hard cap of 12 FTEs on the initiative; kill-or-scale review at $2M ARR in Q3.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"border-t pt-7\" style=\"border-color:#1a1a2e;\">\n<p class=\"text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] font-semibold\" style=\"color:#0f766e;\">Asks of this board</p>\n<div class=\"mt-7 space-y-6\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">01</span>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Approve $9M incremental FY27 investment</span> — $5M channel expansion, $3M onboarding automation, $1M field-service launch.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">02</span>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Approve 28 net new hires</span> — 16 in partner sales and success, 12 capped for field service; zero net additions to enterprise support.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-medium w-6 shrink-0\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\">03</span>\n<p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Ratify the \"not\" list</span> — a formal resolution declining enterprise deals above 1,000 vehicles and deferring continental Europe to FY28 review.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-[12px] mt-6 pt-5 border-t\" style=\"color:#9a9a94; border-color:#e3e3de;\">Decision requested at this meeting. With approval today, all three priorities are staffed and in motion by end of Q1 FY27.</p>\n</div>\n</section>"
  ]
}